{{!
    @template mod_lightboxgallery/edit/page

    The image editing page: the image's thumbnail and caption beside the chosen tool.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * showthumb - Whether to show the thumbnail.
    * thumbnailurl - The thumbnail's URL.
    * caption - The image's caption.
    * tool - HTML for the chosen tool.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "showthumb": true,
        "thumbnailurl": "https://example.com/pluginfile.php/1/mod_lightboxgallery/gallery_thumbs/0/bus.png.png",
        "caption": "The school bus",
        "tool": "<p>The tool</p>"
    }
}}
<div class="mod-lightboxgallery-edit d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center align-items-start gap-4">
    {{#showthumb}}
        <figure class="mod-lightboxgallery-edit-image text-center">
            <img src="{{thumbnailurl}}" alt="">
            {{#caption}}<figcaption title="{{caption}}">{{caption}}</figcaption>{{/caption}}
        </figure>
    {{/showthumb}}
    <div class="mod-lightboxgallery-edit-tool">
        {{{tool}}}
    </div>
</div>
